     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">Hi,</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">I have created a rhandsontable using your package as follows:</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br></p><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;word-wrap:normal;padding:16px;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;display:inline;overflow:visible;line-height:inherit;word-wrap:normal;background:transparent\"><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;margin-bottom:16px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;word-wrap:normal;padding:16px;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;display:inline;overflow:visible;line-height:inherit;word-wrap:normal;background:transparent\">server.R\r\noutput$example &lt;- rhandsontable::renderRHandsontable({\r\nreturn(rhandsontable(data,height=150) %&gt;&gt;%\r\n         hot_table(stretchH=&quot;all&quot;,overflow=&quot;visible&quot;,readOnly = TRUE,readOnly = TRUE) %&gt;&gt;%\r\n         hot_context_menu(allowRowEdit = FALSE, allowColEdit = FALSE)\r\n         )\r\n})</code></pre>\r\n</code></pre><div><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;display:inline;overflow:visible;line-height:inherit;word-wrap:normal;background:transparent\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">Now at a later stage, I would like to access an instance of this rhandsontable using javascript and make some alterations to it. I am currently unable to retrieve an instance of that rhansontable created above.</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">I tried the following in my Javascript but it did not work</span><br></code></div><div><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;display:inline;overflow:visible;line-height:inherit;word-wrap:normal;background:transparent\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&